/extras/b12296cc8e289bdf04453889eb818f40.webp?t=1756474542\" width=167 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851730/extras/7dae3bdcbafe9b392aa7acf598c3c75d.poster.avif?t=1756474542\" width=780 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851730/extras/7dae3bdcbafe9b392aa7acf598c3c75d.webm?t=1756474542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851730/extras/7dae3bdcbafe9b392aa7acf598c3c75d.mp4?t=1756474542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the coins dropped by enemies to enhance your hero's power, level up your enemies, and unlock powerful divine interventions. Each upgrade adds the potential for you to vanquish more enemies or earn more coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851730/extras/d772a15ad6e0e1e23eac3a33f0b9753a.webp?t=1756474542\" width=195 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851730/extras/448156c02b72822379bd2cad4d6ff24f.poster.avif?t=1756474542\" width=780 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851730/extras/448156c02b72822379bd2cad4d6ff24f.webm?t=1756474542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851730/extras/448156c02b72822379bd2cad4d6ff24f.mp4?t=1756474542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph